    <edge source="Adrenal Glands" target="Adrenal Tumors">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Adrenal tumors form in the adrenal glands, indicating a direct relationship between the body’s hormone-producing glands and the tumors that may develop there.&lt;SEP&gt;Adrenal tumors form in the adrenal glands, indicating a direct relationship between these endocrine organs and the tumors that may develop there.</data>
