    <edge source="Adrenal Glands" target="Cushing Syndrome">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Cushing syndrome arises from dysfunction in the adrenal glands, linking glandular health to stress response.&lt;SEP&gt;Cushing syndrome arises from dysfunction in the adrenal glands, which produce the hormones involved in this condition.</data>
