    <edge source="Squamous Cell Skin Cancer" target="Marjolin’s Ulcer">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Marjolin's ulcer is a specific type of squamous cell skin cancer that arises from chronic wounds, burns, or scars, indicating a direct subtype relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;Marjolin's ulcer is identified as a specific form of squamous cell skin cancer that arises in chronic wounds or burns, indicating its association with skin cancer.</data>
