      <data key="d5">Smoking is a major risk factor for many types of cancer, contributing to their development and progression.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoking significantly increases the risk of developing various types of cancer, including lung and head and neck cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoking significantly increases the risk of developing various types of cancers, particularly lung cancer.</data>
