    <edge source="Surgery" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiation therapy can impact surgical outcomes and is often part of the treatment plan for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery is often followed by radiation therapy to kill any remaining cancer cells after tumor removal.</data>
