    </edge>
    <edge source="Surgery" target="Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT)">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Surgery increases the risk of developing deep vein thrombosis, necessitating careful post-operative monitoring.</data>
