      <data key="d4">19.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Surgery is a primary intervention for the treatment of cervical cancer, particularly in early stages.")&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery is often recommended as a primary treatment method for localized cervical cancer when feasible.</data>
