      <data key="d4">30.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN experts recommend regular skin exams for patients who have had squamous cell carcinoma to monitor for recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN experts recommend regular skin exams post-treatment to monitor for any recurrence of skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin exams are recommendations made by NCCN Experts to ensure early detection of potential skin cancer developments.</data>
