      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The lymphatic system plays a key role in CLL as it houses many B cells, which can become cancerous in this condition.&lt;SEP&gt;The lymphatic system's involvement is critical in CLL development, as it contains many B cells that can become cancerous.</data>
