      <data key="d7">chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Egg Freezing" target="Surrogacy">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Egg freezing can allow women to use a surrogate in the future, especially after undergoing cancer treatment that affects fertility.</data>
      <data key="d6">fertility preservation, surrogate pregnancy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ovarian Transposition" target="EBRT">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Ovarian transposition is often performed prior to EBRT to protect ovarian function from radiation damage.</data>
