    </edge>
    <edge source="Transanal Local Excision" target="Recurrence Monitoring">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Monitoring is crucial after transanal local excision to ensure that the tumor does not return, indicating the need for follow-up procedures.</data>
