    <edge source="Transabdominal Surgery" target="Chemoradiation">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Following chemoradiation, transabdominal surgery may be indicated if signs of remaining cancer are present.&lt;SEP&gt;Transabdominal surgery may be recommended after chemoradiation if there are signs of persistent cancer.</data>
