      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Low Anterior Resection is a specific type of transabdominal surgery performed on tumors in the mid to upper rectum.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Anterior Resection is a subtype of transabdominal surgery focused on mid to upper rectal tumors.</data>
