      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Abdominoperineal Resection is a variant of transabdominal surgery focused on the lower rectum and anus, necessitating a permanent colostomy.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdominoperineal Resection is another approach under transabdominal surgery for lower rectal tumors.</data>
