      <data key="d4">20.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemoradiation is the recognized primary treatment for non-metastatic anal cancers, combining chemotherapy and radiation for optimal effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemoradiation serves as the primary treatment strategy for most non-metastatic anal cancers, combining both treatment methods.</data>
