    </edge>
    <edge source="Performance Status (PS)" target="Care Team">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Performance status is assessed by the care team to guide treatment planning and patient care decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The performance status of a patient is evaluated by the care team to help inform treatment decisions and gauge overall health.</data>
