    <edge source="Stereotactic Biopsy" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A stereotactic biopsy is a specific type of biopsy used to obtain tissue from the brain with high precision.&lt;SEP&gt;Stereotactic biopsy is a recommended method for obtaining tissue samples when the tumor is located in delicate or difficult areas of the brain.</data>
