    </edge>
    <edge source="Squamous Cell Carcinoma" target="Cervical Cancer">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Squamous cell carcinoma is a type of cervical cancer requiring specific treatment protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;Squamous cell carcinoma is identified as the most prevalent form of cervical cancer, highlighting a specific type of this disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Squamous cell carcinoma is one of the types of cervical cancer that influences treatment pathways and staging considerations.</data>
