    </edge>
    <edge source="Lymph Nodes" target="Bone Marrow">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Bone marrow produces lymphocytes that travel to lymph nodes, where they participate in filtering lymph and fighting infections.</data>
